         </property>
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optional name for combined results of all the spectrum files: after the files are searched, their spectra, features and PrSMs are merged into &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;_ms2.msalign and related files and the post-search steps are repeated on them, giving &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;_ms2_topmg_* results. A relative name is placed in the folder of the first spectrum file (sorted by path). Enabled when the list has two or more files; empty by default (no combined results). (topmg -c, --combined-file-name)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>Combined output file: </string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QLineEdit" name="combinedOutputEdit">
